@startuml
title Subfigure: #15 链式调用三步时序

participant "test code" as TC
participant "executeMove" as MV
database "internalStore" as IS
database "publicStore" as PS

== Step 1: literal → $r0 ==
TC -> MV : executeMove(\n  literal{'chain'} → $r0)
MV -> IS : set('$r0', 'chain')
note over IS : $r0 = "chain"

== Step 2: $r0 → $r1 ==
TC -> MV : executeMove(\n  $r0 → $r1)
MV -> IS : get('$r0')
MV -> IS : set('$r1', 'chain')
note over IS : $r0 = "chain"\n$r1 = "chain"

== Step 3: $r1 → public ==
TC -> MV : executeMove(\n  $r1 → public{'final_output'})
MV -> IS : get('$r1')
MV -> PS : set('final_output', 'chain')
note over PS : final_output = "chain"

note right of TC
  三步全部独立完成
  没有任何一步需要等待前一步的中间产物
  （除 from 引用外）
end note

@enduml
